### Component: MCQ Assignments Support

#### [MODIFY] [AssignmentCard.tsx](file:///d:/TechPlatform/skillarena/src/features/courses/components/AssignmentCard.tsx)
- Check if `assignment.type === 'mcq'` and render the question/options correctly.
- Add radio button selections for MCQ options, binding selection to the `answer` state.
- Disable selections and display correct/incorrect styling once the submission has been completed/approved.

#### [MODIFY] [page.tsx](file:///d:/TechPlatform/skillarena/src/app/\(dashboard\)/courses/[courseId]/[lessonId]/page.tsx)
- Update `submitAssignment` server action to check the submitted MCQ answer:
  - If `assign.type === 'mcq'`, retrieve the correct answer index from `assign.question.correct_index`.
  - Validate the submitted answer index: if correct, set `status = 'approved'`, award XP, and save the score as `100`.
  - If incorrect, set `status = 'rejected'`, award no XP, and save the score as `0`. Throw an error informing the student their answer was incorrect so they can retry.

#### [MODIFY] [CurriculumBuilder.tsx](file:///d:/TechPlatform/skillarena/src/features/admin/components/CurriculumBuilder.tsx)
- Add `'mcq'` as an option in the "Submission Type" dropdown.
- When `'mcq'` is selected, dynamically render inputs for the MCQ question details:
  - Prompt/Question text.
  - Option list inputs (4 options).
  - Select dropdown for correct option index (0 to 3).
- Package this object into the JSON payload representing the `question` field.

#### [MODIFY] [builder-actions.ts](file:///d:/TechPlatform/skillarena/src/features/admin/actions/builder-actions.ts)
- Update `addAssignment` and `updateAssignment` server actions to read the `question` JSON structure from the form data and update the database column accordingly.

